{
  "_comment": "Local models by role (ADR-120). Copy into ~/.shams/settings.json (user) or <project>/.shams/settings.json. Model names are preferences: SHAMS maps them onto the IDs Ollama really has (see `shams models`). Paths below are an example Windows layout. Presets (ADR-121) are what Direct Mode offers; an adult-only preset needs general.allow_adult_content and runs only when the user picks it.",
